        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion SH-A2, Modern Cast Stainless Steel Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe unique and modern shape of Fusion Hardware's SH-A2 Leverset is inherently contemporary making it the perfect addition to any space with clean lines and a sleek appearance. The concealed mounting screws insure that the sophisticated design is left unmarred. Made out of cast stainless steel, it is available in either brushed or polished finishes. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion SH-A2 Contemporary Stainless Steel Lever With Contemporary Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw assembly for sleek appearance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Modern SH-A2 Stainless Steel Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern 3030 Stainless Steel Leverset, Fusion SH-A2",
                "description": "Cast Stainless Steel Leverset Fusion SH-A2 - The unique and modern shape of Fusion Hardware's SH-A2 Leverset is inherently contemporary making it the perfect addition to any space with clean lines and a sleek appearance. The concealed mounting screws insure that the sophisticated design is left unmarred. Made out of cast stainless steel, it is available in either brushed or polished finishes. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
